// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Ndera Neuropsychiatric Teaching Hospital — Social Worker (Allied Health
// Sciences Unit) mock exams. Category: other-professional (RW).
//
// Grounding: Ndera Hospital's "Allied Health Sciences Unit" is a real,
// confirmed service department of the hospital (its central clinical
// department by patient volume), alongside its Neuropsychiatric Unit and
// Mental Health and Nursing Unit. Ndera Hospital also runs a real
// Medication-Assisted Treatment (MAT) programme for opioid use disorders.
// The Rwanda Allied Health Professions Council (RAHPC) is a statutory body
// established under Law N°46/2012 of 14/01/2013, and lists Social Work among
// the professions it regulates. A comparable real Rwandan hospital posting
// (King Faisal Hospital Kigali, Social Worker) required a bachelor's degree
// (A0) in Social Work, 3+ years of hospital experience, and registration
// with the relevant professional council — used here as a grounded
// comparator since the exact Ndera posting text was not available. The rest
// of the content is standard, well-established medical/psychiatric
// social-work professional knowledge.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

const SOCIAL_WORKER_PROFESSION = { slug: 'social-worker', name: 'Social Worker' };

const SW_ASSESS = 'Psychosocial assessment';
